Package: kofdata
Type: Package
Version: 0.2.1
Title: Get Data from the 'KOF Datenservice' API
Description: Read Swiss time series data from the 'KOF Data' API,
        <https://datenservice.kof.ethz.ch>. The API provides macro
        economic time series data mostly about Switzerland. The package
        itself is a set of wrappers around the 'KOF Datenservice' API.
        The 'kofdata' package is able to consume public information as
        well as data that requires an API token.
